    "translation": "Ouvi-me"
  },
  {
    "verse": 9,
    "original": "אֱלֹהֵי הַיְשׁוּעָה",
    "transliteration": "'elohey hayeshv'ah",
    "translation": "Deus da salvação"
  },
  {
    "verse": 10,
    "original": "כִּי הִנֵּה",
    "transliteration": "khiy hineh",
    "translation": "Pois eis que"
